[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=7 format=3]

; Menu theme — the corporate register, per DESIGN_BIBLE §4/§6.
; UI copy is corporate (clean, sharp, terse); the cult accent is the violet edge.
; Panels are translucent so the menu art still reads through them.

